<title>USA: Cornerstone sets initial quarterly $0.30.</title>
<headline>Cornerstone sets initial quarterly $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cornerstone Properties Inc declared an initial dividend of $0.30 per share after making an initial public offering last month.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend was payable on April 30 to shareholders of record March 21.</p>
<p>It said it expected to maintain its quarterly dividend at $0.30 a share for the &quot;foreseeable future in order to bring its Funds From Operations (FFO) payout ratio (currently at 88 percent) in line with its peers.&quot;</p>
<p>The company had its initial public offering on April 17.</p>
</text>
